hysical"],"flavourText":"Hot drink machine that has had its temperature control module disrupted by Originium. The super-heated drinks it delivers bring physical and psychological trauma. Prize winner of the Engineering Department's 10th Ignoble Prize awards, though it will not be long before the complaints overflow the department's inbox.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":3800,"atk":400,"def":240,"res":35,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"blast_proof_cargo_helper":{"slug":"blast_proof_cargo_helper","name":"Blast-Proof Cargo Helper","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blast-Proof Cargo Helper.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"It will brave the chaos and deliver the goods safely to their destination, even when all hell is breaking loose on Rhodes Island. Designed to transport dangerous cargo to begin with, it certainly could not care less whether they are dangerous.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Self-destructs immediately when there is an Operator nearby, dealing a large amount of Arts damage to surrounding units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":1100,"def":250,"res":35,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"rampaging_maintenance_helper":{"slug":"rampaging_maintenance_helper","name":"Rampaging Maintenance Helper","icon":"/enemies-icons/Rampaging Maintenance Helper.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Maintenance Helper whose IFF module has been disrupted by Originium. The drill carefully added by the Engineering Department with a safety clutch is now much more dangerous. 'Power output? Look, our priorities are providing our operators with a safe working environment and sufficient moral support, not making this thing do complex work.'","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":2500,"atk":360,"def":200,"res":25,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"static_oneiros_enemy_10080_mpiced":{"slug":"static_oneiros_enemy_10080_mpiced","name":"Static Oneiros α","icon":"/enemies-icons/Static Oneiros α.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Originating from an archived enemy. It seems unremarkable, but is able to strike before our operators take action. The mechanism by which it does so is unknown.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Shortly after it enters the battle, throws a bomb to temporarily disable the Operator with the highest DP cost in your Deployment Waiting Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":500,"def":360,"res":40,"elementalRes":10,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"frozen_monstrositys_echo":{"slug":"frozen_monstrositys_echo","name":"'Frozen Monstrosity's Echo'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Frozen Monstrosity's Echo'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Originating from an archived enemy who was once a staunch defender of hearth and home. Originium has recorded and recreated her last waking moment before collapse. She suspects this place of being yet another illusion of the curse, and of her future fate.","abilities":["When defeated, the tile underneath becomes unavailable for deployment"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":450,"def":1100,"res":60,"elementalRes":10,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"intrusive_call":{"slug":"intrusive_call","name":"Intrusive Call","icon":"/enemies-icons/Intrusive Call.